{"version":2,"sourceHash":"1822d08b1cf0edd0475c92c0afa22fe040cec6e8e632f2e40817de52b7dfdd2e","locale":"zh-CN","id":"ep-27a","no":"EP.27A","tag":"第27话 番外 · 惩罚","title":"惩罚","rev":2,"beats":[{"id":"ep-27a:1","s":"n","t":"仓库门开启的清晨，离面包店很远的上游，水撞石激起白浪，黑虎独自蜷着。","bg":"river","tone":"dark","bgm":"gloom2","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27a:2","s":"n","t":"背上十二道黑手印，伤在破披风下抽痛。它没舔，仿佛舔了就承认疼。","l":null,"c":{"who":"tiger","x":"sad"},"r":null},{"id":"ep-27a:3","s":"n","t":"它摸索披风内。纸裹面包仍在，一夜后暖意尽失，只剩形状。"},{"id":"ep-27a:4","s":"tiger","t":"您说过，凉了就只是面包呢。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-27a:5","s":"n","t":"展开旁边纸条，歪斜写着三个字，是祭典岛打鼓、被它收走掌声的孩子的名字。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27a:6","s":"tiger","t":"还打鼓吗？即使没有掌声。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-27a:7","s":"n","t":"纸条无答。它折回，指尖比合账本时小心许多。"},{"id":"ep-27a:8","s":"n","t":"没拿面包，只确认位置。鼓手名字的纸条与面包，账外之物变成两件。"},{"id":"ep-27a:9","s":"n","t":"展开账本，Yeoni栏写着余额为零，下面却隐现从未写过的一行。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27a:10","s":"sys","t":"[ 账本 · 乙亥 Yeoni · 未收款 1 ]"},{"id":"ep-27a:11","s":"tiger","t":"未收款，是说什么呢。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27a:12","s":"n","t":"意味着尚有未收的代价。它用爪刮那行，没擦掉，反而更清晰。"},{"id":"ep-27a:13","s":"tiger","t":"我还有什么没收？那孩子连明天都交完了。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-27a:14","s":"n","t":"话出，额上的触感重来：一无所剩的孩子用额头推环，还有「疼就说疼」的声音。"},{"id":"ep-27a:15","s":"n","t":"它取走的是运气，可账本说它自己收了某样东西，某样还没能归还的东西。"},{"id":"ep-27a:16","s":"n","t":"右前爪黑环发红，一格格收紧，传出压骨的响声。","im":true,"fx":"thread","sfx":"heartbeat","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"thread","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27a:17","s":"tiger","t":"呃啊。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-27a:18","s":"n","t":"河面划开黑裂缝，是被挤到另一片天空的间隙，声音沿环流入。","bg":"hands","tone":"dark","bgm":"zeroPoint","shot":"wide","scene":{"background":"hands","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: hands","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"hands 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27a:19","s":"heuk","t":"虎儿，抱住吾之容器的前爪，竟还留着。"},{"id":"ep-27a:20","s":"tiger","t":"还在。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27a:21","s":"heuk","t":"可惜，本该早些取下。"},{"id":"ep-27a:22","s":"n","t":"环又紧。它不惨叫，只把爪钉入岩石撑住，最后岩石裂了。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"hands","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: hands","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"hands 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27a:23","s":"heuk","t":"为何来吾这里，记得么。"},{"id":"ep-27a:24","s":"tiger","t":"为在那孩子成为怪物前阻止她。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27a:25","s":"heuk","t":"正是。她如同背叛你一般，终将背叛所有人。"},{"id":"ep-27a:25b","s":"heuk","t":"给你阻止她机会的，是谁。"},{"id":"ep-27a:26","s":"tiger","t":"是您。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27a:27","s":"heuk","t":"这份恩情，你忘了吗？"},{"id":"ep-27a:28","s":"tiger","t":"没有忘，一天也没有。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27a:29","s":"heuk","t":"可你却从那河里救了她。"},{"id":"ep-27a:30","s":"n","t":"老虎无答，只有水声。为什么那样做，它自己也不懂。"},{"id":"ep-27a:31","s":"n","t":"代替回答，浮起一个场景。非它所选，每逢环紧，那画面便先漏出来。","bg":"rainStop","tone":"desat","bgm":"memWater","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"rainStop","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: rainStop","transition":"crossfade","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"rainStop 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27a:32","s":"n","t":"雨中车站的湿长椅，及某人倾过半把伞的手，脸总被雨线遮住。"},{"id":"ep-27a:33","s":"n","t":"接着是同一只手推开它的场景，可是否真是同一只手，总模糊不清。"},{"id":"ep-27a:34","s":"n","t":"记忆总断在此，黑月的声音填满断处。那孩子会背叛，会背叛。","sfx":"rain"},{"id":"ep-27a:35","s":"heuk","t":"问你一件事。那个面包，多少钱？","bg":"hands","tone":"dark","bgm":"zeroPoint","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":{"who":"tiger","x":"sad"},"r":null,"scene":{"background":"hands","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: hands","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"hands 배경에서 진행되는 heuk의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-27a:36","s":"tiger","t":"什么？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27a:37","s":"heuk","t":"你披风有气味，账上没有的气味。"},{"id":"ep-27a:38","s":"n","t":"它下意识用前爪护住披风，这动作成了回答。缝后传来笑声。"},{"id":"ep-27a:39","s":"heuk","t":"无物免费。那面包的价，终要以你的血来结。"},{"id":"ep-27a:40","s":"tiger","t":"面包由我偿还。请别碰那家店。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-27a:41","s":"heuk","t":"哦？是在命令我？"},{"id":"ep-27a:42","s":"tiger","t":"是在请求您。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-27a:43","s":"n","t":"环最后猛紧，它向前栽倒，脸砸入河里，冷水灌进鼻中。","im":true,"fx":"veil","sfx":"glitch","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"hands","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: hands","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"veil","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"hands 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27a:44","s":"heuk","t":"允你所求。代价是去办事。"},{"id":"ep-27a:45","s":"heuk","t":"那孩子今晨去了人间，猫也披着人的面皮跟去了。"},{"id":"ep-27a:46","s":"heuk","t":"你也用人的面容去。了结之处，在那一边。"},{"id":"ep-27a:47","s":"tiger","t":"人的面容，早就失去了。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27a:48","s":"heuk","t":"还你便是。不过是借，利息你该懂。"},{"id":"ep-27a:49","s":"n","t":"黑毛如雨流落，爪变手，利爪变指甲。环未消失，化作细金线嵌进右腕。","fx":"transform","sfx":"whoosh","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"hands","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: hands","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"transform","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"hands 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27a:50","s":"n","t":"裂缝合上，河边一个湿发女人跪着，手仍握账本。"},{"id":"ep-27a:51","s":"n","t":"女人过了许久才翻披风。披风变黑大衣，内袋装着一纸条、一面包。","bg":"river","tone":"desat","bgm":"rainWindow","shot":"quiet","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"crossfade","tone":"desat","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27a:52","s":"n","t":"拆纸后面包已凉，她仍咬一口。"},{"id":"ep-27a:53","s":"n","t":"凉面包仍有甜和黄油香，账上记不下的滋味，在舌尖慢慢散开。"},{"id":"ep-27a:54","s":"n","t":"女人的肩膀颤了一下。她没有哭。只是雨水顺着脸流了下来。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27a:55","s":"n","t":"她只吃一半，又把剩下一半包好。没人问为什么，问了大概也答不出。"},{"id":"ep-27a:56","s":"n","t":"雨夜，旧公寓走廊荧光灯闪着。尽头并排两家，其中一家门前有破角伞架。","bg":"aptHall","tone":"dark","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"aptHall","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: aptHall","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"aptHall 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27a:57","s":"n","t":"隔壁空屋门前，多了一把黑伞。雨水从伞尖一滴滴落到地板上。"},{"id":"ep-27a:58","s":"n","t":"门开又关，走廊只留雨味。","sfx":"door"},{"id":"ep-27a:59","s":"n","t":"空屋地上积尘。她不点灯，站到窗前，湿外套滴答落水。","l":null,"c":{"who":"tiger","x":"base"},"r":null},{"id":"ep-27a:60","s":"n","t":"薄墙后有什么落地，随后传来梦呓般的低语。","sfx":"thud"},{"id":"ep-27a:61","s":"n","t":"只有「袜子」一词清楚传来，余下淹在雨里，听不出是谁。"},{"id":"ep-27a:62","s":"n","t":"她掌贴墙，右腕金线冷亮。墙后低语忽断，像睡着的人也察觉了这边。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"aptHall","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: aptHall","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"aptHall 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27a:63","s":"tiger","t":"连这里，您也这么吵呢。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-27a:64","s":"n","t":"她收手，不脱湿衣，坐地背靠墙，等墙后声音渐息。"},{"id":"ep-27a:65","s":"n","t":"膝上账本，那行未收款在黑暗中微亮。她看了很久，才合拢。","im":true,"shot":"quiet","scene":{"background":"aptHall","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: aptHall","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"aptHall 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}}]}
